  <!-- Annotation Notes -->
  (text "CRITICAL SAFETY HARDWARE CONFIGURATION:\n1. GPIO25 is driven HIGH immediately upon boot to keep PCA9685 tristated.\n2. R6 (10k pull-up) guarantees /OE remains HIGH even if ESP32 is unpowered or held in reset.\n3. GPIO27 optocoupler triggers hardware interrupt on contact break (< 100 us shutdown latency)."
